{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05582","headline":"云阳驿陪崔使君邵道士夜宴 · 张子容","name":"云阳驿陪崔使君邵道士夜宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一尉东南远，谁知此夜欢。\n诸侯倾皁盖，仙客整黄冠。\n染翰灯花满，飞觞云气寒。\n欣承国士遇，更借美人看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}